      "message": "Yes, this is the [DanglingPointerDetector](https://skia.org/docs/dev/design/dangling_pointer_detector/). This will be enforced after I apply the MiraclePtr rewrite.  e.g. turning every `T*` into `raw_ptr\u003cT\u003e`. This patch is a preliminary one to avoid adding `DanglingUntriaged`.\n\n---\n\nYou will be able to detect regressions, e.g. a developer causing a pointer somewhere to become dangling after a change, provided Skia is testing this behavior at runtime.",
